  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160249",
      "en": "These ruins go on forever.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160250",
      "en": "Imagine this place at its height.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160251",
      "en": "Not my first choice for a colony.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160252",
      "en": "This place has seen better times.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160254",
      "en": "Too much cover here.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160255",
      "en": "Watch your step.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160256",
      "en": "I bet this place was pretty impressive back in the day.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160258",
      "en": "Even in their ruins, the majesty of the Protheans is evident.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160259",
      "en": "Imagine what this place was like in its glory.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160261",
      "en": "I can't believe most of these buildings are still standing after 50,000 years.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160262",
      "en": "I can see why people keep trying to colonize this world. Most of the infrastructure is still intact.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160264",
      "en": "All this rubble makes good cover for snipers.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160265",
      "en": "These ruins are crawling with vermin -- organic and synthetic.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160267",
      "en": "The geth have brought ruin to this world. As they do to every world.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_WAR40_00_DSG_LOC|war40_banter_00_D|160268",
      "en": "This city was once a marvel of Prothean technology. Now it's nothing but a graveyard.",
      "tr": ""
    }
  ]
}